had a bunch of changes this season.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:42.800
Because that will affect what happens to them
in the future.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:46.920
I'm going to do all the character from the
finale first just because we just got done

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:50.530
watching them, then I'll circle back around
and do the other big characters.

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.840
In case I feel like this video gets too long
just because there are so many characters,

00:00:55.840 --> 00:00:58.450
