but I predict that the show will follow her

00:06:12.469 --> 00:06:14.729
story in the book pretty closely.

00:06:14.729 --> 00:06:18.009
If you haven't read the books and want to
read that part.

00:06:18.009 --> 00:06:22.930
Arya's story picks up in Book 4 Arya Chapter
1.

00:06:22.930 --> 00:06:24.809
She's a POV character in book 4.

00:06:24.809 --> 00:06:28.802
That first chapter of her's takes place immediately
after that last scene with her on the boat

00:06:28.802 --> 00:06:29.949
in the finale.

00:06:29.949 --> 00:06:33.979
So anyone who wants to read the books during
the hiatus, Book 4 would be a good place to

00:06:33.979 --> 00:06:36.469
