00:07:39.839 --> 00:07:44.740
If you want to read those parts but you haven't
read book 4 you won't really be spoiling yourself.

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:46.759
Because it's all happening at the same time.

00:07:46.759 --> 00:07:54.240
